docs {
  `GET /api/v2/authentication/seamless/forcustomer/{customerdid}`

  Get a seamless authentication token for a customer, for sign-in to other Freedom Suite applications.

  Required scope: `api/Read`

  Fill in the path parameters on the **Params** tab before sending.
